      "message": "[error] Line 190: 🔴 `ScrubberSlider` overrides `beginTracking`/`endTracking` but never emits touch lifecycle events (or calls `super`), while `MediaSeekSlider.Coordinator` relies on `.touchDown`/`.touchUp*` to toggle `isSeeking` and to call `onSeekStart`/`onSeekEnd`. This can leave `isSeeking` false during drag, so seek updates are not forwarded (`PlayerView` gates seeks on `coordinator.isSeeking`) and preview/call player seek behavior becomes inconsistent. Emit the control events explicitly in `beginTracking`/`endTracking` (and `cancelTracking`) or call `super` in a way that preserves these events.",
